    "title": "Centerpoint warns customers of rising winter fuel costs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ian Young ,\n53 minutes ago HENDERSON, Ky. (WEHT) — Centerpoint is warning customers to prepare for higher natural gas bills this winter due to rising fuel costs.\nAccording to the U.S. Energy Information Administration households could see a 10% increase in their average monthly heating costs compared to last year. Centerpoint is urging customers to plan ahead and use assistance programs including the customer assistance fund and the Centerpoint Payment Assistance Program.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
